WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.300
The Daily Body Count. Every single day: One hundred and fifty thousand people stop existing.

2
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.680
One hundred and thirty thousand from disease (diseases are very effective at their job).

3
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.060
Eighty thousand were preventable (you had the technology, you just chose not to use it).

4
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:23.500
Thirteen thousand seven hundred are children (which matters if you believe children should continue existing).

5
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:33.520
That's fifty nine-elevens. Every. Single. Day. After the first nine-eleven, America invaded two countries and spent two

6
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:40.040
