17
00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:57.780
Every year. You lose more money to disease than you make doing everything else combined.

18
00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:03.520
It's like running a lemonade stand that costs more in lemons than the entire G.D.P.

19
00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:09.860
