44
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:24.360
The math is simple and horrifying: Value per healthy year: one hundred fifty thousand dollars (less than a Tesla, apparently).

45
00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:30.920
Total D.A.L.Y.s lost annually: two point five five billion years.

46
00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:38.920
Multiply these together: That's three hundred eighty-two point five trillion dollars of human potential.

47
00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:47.340
We flush it annually down the toilet labeled "diseases we haven't cured yet because the money went to bombs.".

48
